capability sql-mysql/errors  a failure told by its code, its number and its SQLSTATE kept in the message
  heroes  sql.database_code_of, sql.FAILED
  go      MySQLError, MySQLError.Error, MySQLError.Is, ErrMalformPkt, ErrPktSync, ErrPktTooLarge, ErrBusyBuffer, ErrOldProtocol
  rust    -
  python  Error, Warning, InterfaceError, DatabaseError, DataError, OperationalError, IntegrityError, InternalError, ProgrammingError, NotSupportedError, MySQLError, err
  note    the number chooses the code (the module's comment), the SQLSTATE's class where the number is not named; PEP 249's classes map onto the codes as the ledger of `sql` says

